{"sha": "aa1607f80d2094ef622dc1515a1edd9559a52e5d4493070da2497c5139b763ad", "body": ["\\chapter{自由电振荡：RLC}\\label{ch:g12:rlc-oscillations}", "", "转动阁楼里老收音机那沉重的旋钮，电台便依次掠过", "指针：一段人声、小提琴、杂音，又是人声。面板之后", "并没有电动机，也没有计算机——只有线圈、一个电容器，其交错的", "极板由旋钮转动，还有一段天线导线。本章", "将上一章的两个储能元件（\\cref{ch:g12:rc-rl-circuits}）", "首尾相连，找到了有史以来最快的“摆”：电荷", "来回振荡，每秒可达数百万次，节奏由旋钮", "选定。", "", "\\section{电摆：LC 电路}", "", "将电容器 $C$ 充电至电压 $U_0$——此时其极板带", "$\\pm Q_0$，且 $Q_0 = C U_0$——然后在 $t = 0$ 时将其接入", "\\emph{理想}线圈 $L$（电阻为零）。回路中没有电源，", "接下来的一切都由电路自身决定。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{circuitikz}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,0) to[C=$C$, v=$u$] (0,2.4) to[nos, l=$K$] (2.6,2.4)", "    -- (3.8,2.4) to[L=$L$, i=$i$] (3.8,0) -- (0,0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.18,1.5) {$+q$};", "  \\node[right, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.18,0.9) {$-q$};", "\\end{circuitikz}", "", "{\\small LC 电路：充电至 $Q_0$ 的电容器、开关和", "一个理想线圈。闭合 $K$，电荷经线圈泄出——而线圈", "厌恶变化，不肯让电流停下来。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[LC 方程]\\label{prop:g12:rlc-oscillations:equation}", "\\index{LC 电路}", "在理想 LC 回路中，上极板的电荷 $q(t)$ 满足", "\\[", "L\\,\\frac{d^2q}{dt^2} + \\frac{q}{C} = 0,", "\\qquad\\text{即}\\qquad", "\\frac{d^2q}{dt^2} = -\\frac{1}{LC}\\,q .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "沿回路各电压之和为零", "由\\cref{prop:g11:circuits-and-power:laws}可知：$u_L + u_C = 0$。", "电容器给出 $u_C = q/C$，线圈给出 $u_L = L\\,di/dt$", "（见\\cref{def:g12:rc-rl-circuits:inductor}），$i = dq/dt$ 按", "流入上极板的电荷计，", "（见\\cref{prop:g12:rc-rl-circuits:cdudt}）；代入即可。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[LC 电路的自由振荡]\\label{thm:g12:rlc-oscillations:oscillation}", "\\index{电振荡}", "在 $t = 0$ 时释放，且 $q(0) = Q_0$，$i(0) = 0$，", "电路做振荡：", "\\[", "q(t) = Q_0 \\cos\\!\\left(\\frac{2\\pi t}{T_0}\\right),", "\\qquad", "i(t) = -I_0 \\sin\\!\\left(\\frac{2\\pi t}{T_0}\\right),", "\\qquad", "T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC},", "\\]", "其中峰值电流为 $I_0 = 2\\pi Q_0/T_0 = Q_0/\\sqrt{LC}$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "代入验证。求导可得", "$i = dq/dt = -\\frac{2\\pi}{T_0} Q_0 \\sin(2\\pi t/T_0)$——即所给的", "$i(t)$；再求一次导，$\\frac{d^2q}{dt^2} = -(\\frac{2\\pi}{T_0})^2 q$，", "它恰好等于 $-q/(LC)$，当且仅当 $(2\\pi/T_0)^2 = 1/(LC)$，", "即 $T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}$。又 $q(0) = Q_0$，$i(0) = 0$。满足方程与初始条件的", "\\emph{其他}函数不存在这一点，在本阶段不加证明地承认，", "与弹簧的情形完全相同", "（见\\cref{rem:g12:oscillators-and-time:uniqueness}）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[固有周期与频率]\\label{def:g12:rlc-oscillations:period}", "LC 电路的\\emph{固有周期}\\index{固有周期!LC 电路}为", "$T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}$；其", "\\emph{固有频率}\\index{固有频率!LC 电路}为", "\\[", "f_0 = \\frac{1}{T_0} = \\frac{1}{2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}} .", "\\]", "量纲检验：$\\qty{1}{H} = \\qty{1}{V.s/A}$，且", "$\\qty{1}{F} = \\qty{1}{C/V}$，因此 $LC$ 的量纲为", "$\\unit{s} \\times \\unit{C/A} = \\unit{s^2}$——$\\sqrt{LC}$ 是时间，", "这正合要求。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[几个数值]\\label{ex:g12:rlc-oscillations:firstnumbers}", "取 $L = \\qty{10}{mH}$，$C = \\qty{1.0}{\\micro F}$：", "则 $\\sqrt{LC} = \\qty{1.0e-4}{s}$，$T_0 = \\qty{0.63}{ms}$，且", "$f_0 \\approx \\qty{1.6}{kHz}$——这是可闻的音调。取 $L = \\qty{1.0}{mH}$，", "$C = \\qty{100}{pF}$：$T_0 = \\qty{2.0}{\\micro s}$，", "$f_0 \\approx \\qty{0.50}{MHz}$——这是无线电频率。只有", "\\emph{乘积} $LC$ 才决定节奏。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[相差四分之一周期]\\label{rem:g12:rlc-oscillations:quarter}", "电流与电荷相差四分之一周期：$i = 0$", "对应 $q = \\pm Q_0$（极板充满，电流反向），而 $i = \\pm I_0$", "对应 $q = 0$（极板空，电流最大）——恰如", "单摆一样：在两端静止，在最低点最快。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=9.2cm, height=5.0cm, xlabel={$t$},", "    xmin=0, xmax=2, ymin=-1.4, ymax=1.75, xtick={0,0.5,1,1.5,2},", "    xticklabels={$0$,$T_0/2$,$T_0$,$3T_0/2$,$2T_0$},", "    ytick={-1,0,1}, legend pos=north east]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:2, samples=200] {cos(360*x)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:2, samples=200] {-sin(360*x)};", "  \\legend{$q/Q_0$, $i/I_0$}", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}